    tag: "fraction-meaning",
    label: "What a fraction says",
    forms: ["takeSome", "complement"],
    // Grade-3 fraction MEANING across three courses: default `onePart` is "one of n equal parts is
    // 1/n" (fr-01-02's pie and sharing, geo-03-02's pizza slice), `takeSome` is "cut into d, take t
