          `${n} ${s.parts} total, ${k} ${s.bad.replace("still ", "")}, so ${rest} ${s.good}: ${rest}/${n}. Bottom counts every ${s.parts.slice(0, -1)}, top counts the ${s.good} ones.`,
          "any"
