    tag: "rolle-c",
    label: "Rolle's theorem",
    forms: ["cubicRepeated", "maxRoots"],
    // ca-03-01. Default is the quadratic vertex case (k1); `cubicRepeated` mirrors ch1's cubic
    // with a doubled root at 0; `maxRoots` generalizes k3's abstract counting argument to any
