type ExactUpgradeConfig=Pick<TExactNumberLab,"task"|"values"|"operation"|"group"|"inequality"|"targetClass"|"targetRadicand"|"logBase"|"logArgument"|"logResult"|"logDivisor"|"logCoefA"|"logConstB"|"logConstQ"|"logShift"|"radRootIndex"|"radInsideCoef"|"radInsideConst"|"radOuterCoef"|"radOuterConst"|"radRhs"|"extInsideConst"|"extRhsShift"|"rexCoef"|"rexShift"|"rexP"|"rexQ"|"rexRhs"|"limDegNum"|"limDegDenom"|"limLeadNum"|"limLeadDenom"|"polyCoefficients"|"polyAt"|"sysA1"|"sysB1"|"sysC1"|"sysA2"|"sysB2"|"sysC2"|"sysAsk"|"approxConstants"|"approxFormula"|"approxRound"|"pmdTurningPoints"|"pmdEndBehavior"|"esCoef"|"esBaseNum"|"esBaseDen"|"esRhsNum"|"esRhsDen"|"lower"|"upper"|"requiredExplorations"|"requiredStageKeys">;
